ta-astro-cid-rhy6fmgd>Two of our last five projects ended with a spreadsheet, not a model. If a pivot table answers your question, we say so in week one and bill for week one. The rest of the budget stays with you, and so does the spreadsheet. We would rather lose a project than sell you a model you do not need, and we put that promise in writing.</p><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/#enquiry' ) ); ?>" class="btn btn-primary split-btn" data-astro-cid-rhy6fmgd>Book a call</a></div></section>
